Package: GSEAplus
Title: Extended Gene Set Enrichment Analysis Toolkit
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: 
    person("Hanzhou", "Wang", email = "your@email.com", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Tools for running, visualizing, and comparing Gene Set Enrichment
    Analysis (GSEA) across multiple contrasts, cell types, and omics datasets.
    Provides ranked gene list generation, multi-contrast enrichment, heatmap
    matrices, and publication-ready plots.
